Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.05,0:04:49.43,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}愛してるって何だろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.35,0:04:54.68,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}辞書を引いてもピンと来なくて
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.68,0:04:59.60,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}そうね　愛って何だろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.60,0:05:04.57,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}語り尽くせぬこの痛みが愛なんかも
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.40,0:05:11.37,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}始まりの対に終わりを創る
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:15.95,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}神様はとても残酷だよね
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.41,0:05:21.42,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}人間はきっと勇敢なんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.41,0:05:21.42,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fscx60\fscy60\pos(501,666)}ぼくら
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:25.92,OP-JP,,0,500,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}終わりを知れどまだ前へ進むから
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:31.22,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}何を引き換えにしようとも
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.89,0:05:36.27,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}何度だって汚すよこの手なら
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.98,0:05:41.02,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}後悔に似た罪の意識
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.06,0:05:45.98,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}隠して歩む道は何処へと続くの
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:54.49,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}いつか君が死んじゃうって想像するだけで痛いんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.83,0:05:57.16,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}心臓を握りつぶすのは誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.83,0:05:57.16,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fscx60\fscy60\pos(482,666)}こころ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.16,0:05:59.62,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}キミが愛なんだろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:04.29,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}いつか二人を引き離す終わりが迎えに来ようとも
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.29,0:06:09.55,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}誰も追いつけやしないスピードで
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:13.72,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}どこまでも逃げてみせるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.05,0:04:49.43,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}「我爱你」是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.35,0:04:54.68,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}查了辞典也毫无头绪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.68,0:04:59.60,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}对啊 爱究竟是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.60,0:05:04.57,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}这道不尽的痛 或许就是爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.40,0:05:11.37,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}万物有始必有终
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:15.95,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}神明就是这么残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.41,0:05:21.42,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}人类一定都是勇敢的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:25.92,OP-CH,,0,500,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}虽知有终 却从未停下前进的脚步
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:31.22,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}无论代价为何
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.89,0:05:36.27,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}无论要脏了这双手多少次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.98,0:05:41.02,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}罪恶感亦如悔意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.06,0:05:45.98,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}将其隐蔽 带着它走下去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:54.49,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}一想到你终将离世 我便痛入心脾
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.83,0:05:57.16,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}究竟是谁握碎了我的心脏？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.16,0:05:59.62,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}是因为你即我的挚爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:04.29,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}即使终有一日 终结会将你我分离
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.29,0:06:09.55,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}我也会用无人能及的速度
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:13.72,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}逃往天涯海角
Comment: 0,0:23:23.00,0:23:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.35,0:22:11.14,ED-EN,,0,0,0,,I decided to be stronger than anyone around
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:14.40,ED-EN,,0,0,0,,Goodbye old self goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.99,0:22:26.53,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,Now it’s time for me to take a breath
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.58,0:22:31.33,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,You know I don’t want to lose anything
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.00,0:22:35.50,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,Don’t wanna see the end I need this more
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.54,0:22:40.05,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,I want to feel the warmth I can’t let go
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.05,0:22:44.59,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,Not gonna give it up because I know my strength
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.59,0:22:49.47,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,I’m barely breathing but I’m keepin’ up to live my life
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.93,0:22:55.90,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,I decided to be stronger than anyone around
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.90,0:22:59.78,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,I hide my trembling hand and just keep pushin’ on
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.78,0:23:04.70,ED-EN,,0,300,0,,Cause the things I need to guard gives me the power to conquer carry on
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.70,0:23:06.82,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,Goodbye old self
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.82,0:23:11.12,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,Never going back to the me I fought to leave behind
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.12,0:23:14.79,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,Hello new me, this time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.41,0:23:15.79,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(0,720)\fs30\k10\2a&HFF&\c&HFFFFFF&}保{\k10}护{\k10}家{\k10}人{\k10} {\k10}便{\k10}是{\k10}我{\k10}现{\k10}在{\k10}的{\k10}一{\k10}切
